{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "训练孩子与父母说话的习惯", "content": "父母应大量与孩子聊天，让孩子养成与父母说话的习惯。讲师以自身为例，其母亲从小与其沟通，饭后聊天，使其养成什么事都告诉母亲的习惯，后来遇到事情都会告诉母亲，母亲能及时帮忙解决。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["聊天习惯", "亲子沟通"], "evidence": "reported_case", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:a011", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9f55090f1cb8", "blocks": ["b00008", "b00009"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:a009", "kind": "supports", "condition": "具体方法之一", "evidence": "source_extraction"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:u0011"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "让孩子接纳沟通差异", "content": "在4-8岁阶段，要让孩子接纳沟通差异：认识到不同的人有不同的沟通方法，这些差异没有好坏对错之分，只是不同。这是一个人好的沟通的前提，也是沟通成功的第一步。父母应把这种能力植入孩子的沟通中，使孩子的沟通成为开放式沟通。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我认知"], "tags": ["沟通差异", "开放沟通", "4-8岁"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:a012", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9f55090f1cb8", "blocks": ["b00009"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:v2-n001", "kind": "association", "condition": "4-8岁阶段沟通能力培养", "reason": "source 聚焦于沟通关键词“感觉”和安全氛围等必要条件；candidate 涉及让孩子接纳沟通差异，虽同在4-8岁阶段，但非 source 提及的必要条件，仅主题相关，不确定因果关系。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}, {"target": "s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:v2-n002", "kind": "association", "condition": "4-8岁接纳差异", "reason": "年龄不同，内容不同，无直接关系。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:u0012"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "回应孩子的肢体语言", "content": "在4-8岁阶段，孩子因语言能力有限，更愿意用肢体表达自己。父母应仔细观察并回应孩子的肢体语言，例如当孩子沮丧或垂头丧气时，不要因忙碌而忽略，可以询问：“你今天下午很安静，发生什么事情了吗？”“你是有点不高兴吗？你的情绪是有点低落吗？”", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["肢体语言", "观察", "4-8岁"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:a013", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9f55090f1cb8", "blocks": ["b00010", "b00011"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [], "knowledge_units": ["s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:u0013"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "9-12岁孩子的沟通关键词：高质量", "content": "9-12岁孩子的沟通关键词是“高质量”。因为此时孩子学业繁忙，不太有时间玩耍和聊天，所以质量要取代数量。婴儿时期用数量取胜，但9-12岁时期用质量取胜。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["高质量沟通", "9-12岁"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:a014", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9f55090f1cb8", "blocks": ["b00011", "b00012"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:a015", "kind": "prerequisite", "condition": "高质量沟通需要定期沟通作为前提。", "reason": "定期沟通是9-12岁孩子沟通的必要条件，是实现高质量沟通的基础。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:a016", "kind": "supports", "condition": "高质量沟通要求沟通目的是增进彼此了解。", "reason": "明确沟通目的是实现高质量沟通的关键。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:a017", "kind": "supports", "condition": "高质量沟通是双向倾听。", "reason": "双向倾听是高质量沟通的表现形式。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:a018", "kind": "causes", "condition": "高质量沟通会建立孩子的自尊心和自信心。", "reason": "高质量沟通的益处包括建立自尊自信。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:v2-n001", "kind": "conditional_difference", "condition": "当孩子年龄为9-12岁时", "reason": "source 指出 4-8 岁关键词是“感觉”；candidate 指出 9-12 岁关键词是“高质量”，在不同年龄条件下沟通关键词不同，构成条件差异。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}, {"target": "s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:v2-n002", "kind": "association", "condition": "9-12岁高质量", "reason": "年龄不同，内容不同，无直接关系。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:u0014"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "condition", "title": "9-12岁孩子沟通的必要条件：定期沟通", "content": "9-12岁孩子沟通的第一个必要条件是定期沟通。定期指找出一个特别的地方和特别的时间，在日程表上空出来，专门用于与孩子聊天。最好是每一天，如果做不到，起码每个星期有两到三次固定的时间。这个时间没有手机、电脑和任何干扰，父母与孩子单独一起，聊什么都可以，天南海北地聊。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["定期沟通", "9-12岁"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:a015", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9f55090f1cb8", "blocks": ["b00012", "b00013"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:a020", "kind": "supports", "condition": "定期沟通和情绪安全共同构成9-12岁孩子沟通的必要条件。", "reason": "两者都是必要条件，相互支持。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:v2-n001", "kind": "association", "condition": "9-12岁孩子沟通时", "reason": "source 针对 4-8 岁，candidate 是 9-12 岁定期沟通的必要条件，年龄不同，不能混用；无直接关系，仅同属沟通主题。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}, {"target": "s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:v2-n002", "kind": "association", "condition": "9-12岁定期沟通", "reason": "年龄不同，内容不同，无直接关系。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:u0015"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "沟通的目的：增进彼此了解", "content": "与9-12岁孩子沟通的目的必须是为了让双方对彼此更加了解，而不是父母去听孩子说话后指挥或引导孩子。如果父母想着沟通是为了发现孩子思维中的问题并解决，孩子不会买单，因为这个阶段的孩子需要父母也听他的。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["规则与行动"], "tags": ["沟通目的", "相互了解", "9-12岁"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:a016", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9f55090f1cb8", "blocks": ["b00013", "b00014"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:v2-n001", "kind": "association", "condition": "9-12岁孩子沟通目的", "reason": "source 是 4-8 岁关键词，candidate 是 9-12 岁沟通目的，年龄不同，无直接关系。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}, {"target": "s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:v2-n002", "kind": "association", "condition": "9-12岁沟通目的", "reason": "source 是 0-2 安全需求，candidate 是 9-12 沟通目的，主题相关但无直接关系。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:u0016"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
