{"type": "concept", "subtype": "condition", "title": "9-12岁孩子沟通的必要条件：情绪安全", "content": "9-12岁孩子沟通的另一个必要条件是情绪安全。不管孩子跟父母分享什么事情，包括可能有喜欢的男孩子、经历身体上的改变、有与父母不一样的想法或困难，父母都不要大惊小怪。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["理解情绪"], "tags": ["情绪安全", "9-12岁"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:a020", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-9f55090f1cb8", "blocks": ["b00016"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:v2-n001", "kind": "association", "condition": "9-12岁孩子沟通时", "reason": "不同年龄段, source 针对 4-8 岁，candidate 是 9-12 岁情绪安全条件，不能混用，仅主题相关。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}, {"target": "s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:v2-n002", "kind": "association", "condition": "9-12岁情绪安全", "reason": "年龄不同，内容不同，无直接关系。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}, {"target": "legacy:nl-c-15", "kind": "complements", "condition": "均涉及9-12岁高质量沟通条件；候选补充情绪安全必要条件。", "reason": "候选给出9-12岁沟通的另一个必要条件情绪安全，丰富旧原子该年龄段细节。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}, {"target": "legacy:nl-r-04", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用：9-12岁阶段；旧原子关键字为'高质量'", "reason": "候选补充9-12岁沟通的必要条件是情绪安全，父母不要大惊小怪。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-9f55090f1cb8-c001:u0020"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
